<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">(b) </span>After attack (PGD-perturbed)</figcaption>
</figure></div><div class="ltx_flex_break"></div><div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_1"><span class="ltx_rule ltx_figure_panel ltx_minipage ltx_align_center ltx_align_middle" style="width:397.5pt;height:0.4pt;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span></div><div class="ltx_flex_break"></div><div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_2">
<figure id="A5.F2.fig1" class="ltx_figure ltx_figure_panel ltx_align_center">
